{"ticker":"SCHW","updated":"2026-10-30T23:11:04Z","profile":{"longName":"The Charles Schwab Corporation","shortName":"Charles Schwab Corporation (The","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","country":"United States","website":"https://www.aboutschwab.com","fullTimeEmployees":33900,"marketCap":152268013568,"trailingPE":15.051283,"forwardPE":11.283905,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.6268435,"pegRatio":0.74,"targetMeanPrice":117.31818,"targetHighPrice":147.0,"targetLowPrice":82.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.169,"earningsGrowth":0.286,"grossMargins":0.97506,"operatingMargins":0.52669996,"profitMargins":0.39333,"totalRevenue":27061000192,"beta":0.782,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":114.53,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":83.96,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.43},"summary":"The Charles Schwab Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a savings and loan holding company that provides wealth management, securities brokerage, banking, asset management, custody, and financial advisory services in the United States and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Investor Services and Advisor Services. It offers brokerage accounts with equity and fixed income trading, margin lending, options trading, futures and forex trading, and cash management capabilities, including money market funds, and certificates of deposit; third-party mutual funds through the Mutual Fund Marketplace and Mutual Fund OneSource service, as well as mutual fund trading and clearing services to broker-dealers; exchange-traded funds; advisory solutions for managed portfolios, separately managed accounts, customized personal advice for tailored portfolios, specialized planning, and full-time portfolio management; banking products comprising checking and savings accounts, first lien residential real estate mortgage loans, home equity lines of credit, and pledged asset lines; and trust custody services, personal trust reporting services, and administrative trustee services. It provides digital and software based trading platforms; research tools, and multichannel support, real-time market data, options trading; equity compensation plan sponsors full-service re","summary_zh":"嘉信理財公司及其子公司是一家儲蓄和貸款控股公司，在美國和國際上提供財富管理、證券經紀、銀行、資產管理、託管和財務諮詢服務。該公司分為兩個部門：投資者服務部門和顧問服務部門。它為經紀帳戶提供股票和固定收益交易、保證金貸款、期權交易、期貨和外匯交易以及現金管理功能，包括貨幣市場基金和存款證；透過共同基金市場和共同基金 OneSource服務提供第三方共同基金，以及向經紀自營商提供共同基金交易和清算服務；交易所交易基金；管理投資組合的諮詢解決方案、單獨管理的帳戶、針對客製化投資組合的客製化個人建議、專業規劃和全職投資組合管理；銀行產品，包括支票和儲蓄帳戶、第一個留置權住宅房地產抵押貸款、房屋淨值和質押服務。它提供基於數位和軟體的交易平台；研究工具、多通路支援、即時市場數據、選擇權交易；股權激勵計畫發起全方位服務","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資本市場","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":95.35,"h":96.12,"l":94.04,"c":96.12,"v":7741300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":96.21,"h":96.62,"l":95.26,"c":96.22,"v":7261500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":96.87,"h":97.74,"l":96.21,"c":97.63,"v":7504600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":97.23,"h":97.6,"l":91.52,"c":92.05,"v":18240700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":92.18,"h":93.65,"l":91.85,"c":93.45,"v":12681500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":93.57,"h":94.05,"l":91.43,"c":93.67,"v":10773600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":93.15,"h":93.36,"l":91.86,"c":92.24,"v":12543900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":92.28,"h":94.08,"l":91.83,"c":93.94,"v":8724400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":93.93,"h":94.5,"l":93.36,"c":93.54,"v":7701800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":93.76,"h":94.1,"l":91.68,"c":92.1,"v":9645700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":92.33,"h":92.4,"l":90.5,"c":91.03,"v":13613800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":91.07,"h":92.19,"l":90.55,"c":92.09,"v":14497000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":91.92,"h":93.74,"l":91.9,"c":93.28,"v":10439800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":93.36,"h":94.56,"l":92.8,"c":94.33,"v":15163100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":93.67,"h":94.48,"l":93.34,"c":94.43,"v":11076300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":94.01,"h":94.93,"l":93.36,"c":93.91,"v":6914800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":94.06,"h":94.13,"l":91.7,"c":92.37,"v":10336200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":92.39,"h":94.8,"l":92.0,"c":94.78,"v":9203700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":95.13,"h":95.98,"